Z", "platform": 6, "external_game_source": {"id": 20, "name": "Amazon"}, "game_release_format": {"id": 2, "format": "Physical"}}, {"id": 1934383, "uid": "B07SKCXVFX", "platform": 6, "external_game_source": {"id": 20, "name": "Amazon"}, "game_release_format": {"id": 2, "format": "Physical"}}], "franchises": [{"id": 979, "name": "The Sims"}], "game_modes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Single player"}], "genres": [{"id": 12, "name": "Role-playing (RPG)"}, {"id": 13, "name": "Simulator"}, {"id": 15, "name": "Strategy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Adventure"}], "involved_companies": [{"id": 141821, "company": {"id": 1, "name": "Electronic Arts"}, "developer": false}, {"id": 141822, "company": {"id": 284, "name": "Maxis"}, "developer": true}], "name": "The Sims 4: Island Living", "platforms": [169, 48, 6, 167, 14, 49], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 1, "name": "First person"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}, {"id": 3, "name": "Bird view / Isometric"}], "rating": 69.57154588664139, "release_dates": [{"id": 299736, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 299735, "date": 1604966400, "platform": 169, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 173089, "date": 1563235200, "platform": 49, "y": 2019, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 422211, "date": 1560988800, "platform": 6, "y": 2019, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 173087, "date": 1561075200, "platform": 14, "y": 2019, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 173088, "date": 1563235200, "platform": 48, "y": 2019, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 320299, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v57.jpg"}, {"id": 320300, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v58.jpg"}, {"id": 320297, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v55.jpg"}, {"id": 551335, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbtev.jpg"}, {"id": 551326, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbtem.jpg"}, {"id": 551327, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbten.jpg"}], "slug": "the-sims-4-island-living", "storyline": "Take a break from the hustle & bustle and head to Sulani, where the sands are warm and the locals are friendly. Start an inspiring career that enhances the island\u2019s beauty, watch baby turtles hatch or relax by working on your tan. The freedom to chill is yours.\n\nThe sun shines bright on the beautiful islands of Sulani. Dive into the glistening waters where you can paddle a canoe & swim with dolphins. Take to the beaches to build a sand castle, catch some rays & even meet a mermaid!\n\nGo green & become a conservationist by cleaning up the beaches. Watch your Sims\u2019 impact bloom all over the island. Take to the waves as a fisherman, diver or lifeguard. Or take a more laid-back approach by performing odd jobs or fishing for your Sims\u2019 next meal.\n\nDress your Sims in tropical garb inspired by the sun, sand and waves. Turn your beach home into a rustic oasis, then unwind at the tiki bar. Everything is chill (except for the occasional sunburn) here on the island.\n\nTradition runs deep in Sulani: let your Sims experience everything it has to offer. Attend a pit barbecue event, learn about local folklore, taste tropical delicacies and chat with island elders.", "summary": "Explore a breezy world drenched in sun, sand and endless fun as your Sims make their own paradise in The Sims 4: Island Living. Whether they contribute to the conservation effort or prefer living off the grid, your Sims can take the plunge and enjoy what this unique culture has to offer. Embrace traditional events, wear native clothing styles or sip on some kava. It's all part of Sulani island life.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-sims-4-island-living", "videos": [{"id": 52699, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "agwJY6UbQF4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=agwJY6UbQF4", "title": "The Sims 4\u2122 Island Living: Official Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/agwJY6UbQF4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52698, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "ihFbmjYm7CQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ihFbmjYm7CQ", "title": "The Sims 4\u2122 Island Living: Official Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ihFbmjYm7CQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 61, "name": "The Sims"}]}